* Testbench for Cascode Amplifier with Source Follower
.lib "${SKY130_PDK}" tt

* Define parameters used in the netlist
.param W_xm1=10 L_xm1=1
.param W_xm2=10 L_xm2=1
.param W_xm3=20 L_xm3=1
.param W_xm4=20 L_xm4=1
